    "chunk_text": "nytlic. Wi\u00f0 oman & wi\u00f0 eagena sare & wi\u00f0 fotadle genim \u00f0as wyrte butan wyrttruman, cnoca mid Hit hy geli\u00f0iga\u00f0. Wy\u00f0 heafodece genim \u00feysse ylcan wyrte wos & rosan wos, m\u00e6ngc tosomne, smyre \u00fe\u00e6t heafod \u00de\u00e6t sar by\u00f0 geli\u00f0igud. Wy\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6ra wyrma slite \u00fee man spalangiones hate\u00fe genim \u00feas ylcan wyrte aizos on wine gecnucude, Hyt frema\u00f0 nytlice. Wi\u00f0 utsiht & wi\u00f0 inno\u00f0es flewsan & wy\u00f0 wyrmas \u00fee on \u00f0am inno\u00fee deria\u00f0 \u00feeos sylfe wyrt wel Eft wy\u00f0 untrumnysse \u00fe\u00e6ra eagena genim \u00feysse ylcan wyrte wos, smyra \u00f0onne \u00fea eagan \u00fe\u00e6rmid. Nytlice hyt frema\u00f0. Tunsingwyrt. \u00d0eos wyrt \u00fee man elleborum album & o\u00f0rum naman tunsincgwyrt nemne\u00f0 & eac sume men \u00deysse wyrte wyrttruman man sceal niman onbutan midne sumur & eac swa some \u00fea wyrt ealle for \u00de\u00e6t is to lufigenne on \u00f0ysse wyrte \u00fe\u00e6t heo hafa\u00f0 gehw\u00e6dne wyrttruman & na swa rihtne \u00fe\u00e6t he be He by\u00f0 brea\u00fe & tidre \u00feonne he gedriged by\u00f0, & \u00feonne he tobrocen by\u00fe he ryc\u00fe eal swylce he smic \u00deonne beo\u00f0 \u00fea maran wyrttruman lange & hearde & swy\u00fee bittere on byrgincge, & hy habba\u00fe to \u00d0onne sceal man \u00feysne wyrttruman swa we \u00e6r cw\u00e6don gedrigean & \u00fea langnysse",
